  <Document>
    <name>San Dieguito Union High School District - Middle &amp; High School Attendance Boundaries</name>
    <description>Middle and high school attendance boundaries for San Dieguito Union High School District (Carmel Valley / Del Mar / Solana Beach / Encinitas area). Source: NCES School Attendance Boundary Survey (SABS), 2015-2016 school year - the most recent federal survey of this kind. This is roughly 10 years old; boundaries may have shifted since (verify against the district's current locator at https://locator.pea.powerschool.com/?studyId=237927 before relying on it for anything precision-sensitive). 9 schools.</description>
    
